<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Healthcare raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Healthcare raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it upgraded its near-term rating on Sun Healthcare Group Inc to outperform from neutral, keeping a long-term buy on the shares.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- on Wednesday, Sun Healthcare said the criminal division of the U.S. Justice Department informed Sun it had completed its investigation of the company and it would not initiate any actions against Sun or any individuals.</p>
</text>
